      "message": "I have been giving further thoughts to this, since all the signals handled in this file are platform dependent, would it be better to have them inside file zephyr/project/nissa/src/common_pwrseq.c? this way we can avoid extra CONFIGS. I have made quick test, just a few changes required, just CMakeFile\u0027s.",
      "parentUuid": "479caa25_1da9bf23",
